\p “\w Haven’t you|strong="H3808"\w* \w just arrived|strong="H935"\w* \w from a journey|strong="H1870"\w*?” \w David|strong="H1732"\w* \w asked|strong="H559"\w* \w Uriah|strong="H223"\w*. “\w Why|strong="H4069"\w* \w didn’t you|strong="H3808"\w* \w go|strong="H3381"\w* \w home|strong="H1004"\w*?”
