\c 13
\s1 Amnon and Tamar
\p \v 1 \w After some time|strong="H1961"\w*, \w David’s|strong="H1732"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w Amnon|strong="H550"\w* \w fell in love|strong="H157"\w* \w with Tamar|strong="H8559"\w*, \w the beautiful|strong="H3303"\w* \w sister|strong="H269"\w* \w of David’s|strong="H1732"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w Absalom|strong="H53"\w*. \v 2 \w Amnon|strong="H550"\w* \w was sick|strong="H2470"\w* \w with frustration|strong="H3334"\w* \w over|strong="H5668"\w* \w his sister|strong="H269"\w* \w Tamar|strong="H8559"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w she|strong="H1931"\w* \w was a virgin|strong="H1330"\w*, \w and it seemed|strong="H5869"\w* \w implausible|strong="H6381"\w* \w for him|strong="H550"\w* \w to do|strong="H6213"\w* \w anything|strong="H3972"\w* to her.
\p \v 3 \w Now Amnon|strong="H550"\w* \w had a friend|strong="H7453"\w* \w named|strong="H8034"\w* \w Jonadab|strong="H3122"\w*, \w the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of David’s|strong="H1732"\w* \w brother|strong="H251"\w* \w Shimeah|strong="H8093"\w*.\f + \fr 13:3 \fqa Shimeah \ft is a variant of \fqa Shammah\ft , \fqa Shimea\ft , and \fqa Shimei\ft ; see \ref 1 Samuel 16:9|1SA 16:9\ref*, 2 Samuel 21:21, and 1 Chronicles 2:13.\f* \w Jonadab|strong="H3122"\w* \w was a very|strong="H3966"\w* \w shrewd|strong="H2450"\w* \w man|strong="H376"\w*, \v 4 \w and he asked|strong="H559"\w* Amnon, “\w Why|strong="H4069"\w* \w are you|strong="H859"\w*, \w the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w*, \w so|strong="H3602"\w* \w depressed|strong="H1800"\w* \w morning|strong="H1242"\w* \w after morning|strong="H1242"\w*? \w Won’t|strong="H3808"\w* \w you tell|strong="H5046"\w* me?”
