\p \w But he refused|strong="H3808"\w* \w to listen|strong="H8085"\w* to her. \v 17 \w Instead, he called|strong="H7121"\w* \w to his attendant|strong="H5288"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Throw|strong="H7971"\w* \w this woman|strong="H2063"\w* \w out|strong="H2351"\w* \w and bolt|strong="H5274"\w* \w the door|strong="H1817"\w* \w behind her|strong="H310"\w*!”
\p \v 18 \w So Amnon’s attendant|strong="H8334"\w* \w threw|strong="H3318"\w* \w her|strong="H853"\w* \w out|strong="H2351"\w* \w and bolted|strong="H5274"\w* \w the door|strong="H1817"\w* \w behind her|strong="H310"\w*. \w Now Tamar was wearing|strong="H5921"\w* \w a robe|strong="H3801"\w* \w of many colors|strong="H6446"\w*,\f + \fr 13:18 \ft Or \fqa a robe with long sleeves\ft ; see also \ref Genesis 37:3|GEN 37:3\ref*.\f* \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3651"\w* \w the king’s|strong="H4428"\w* \w virgin|strong="H1330"\w* \w daughters|strong="H1323"\w* \w wore|strong="H3847"\w*. \v 19 \w And Tamar|strong="H8559"\w* \w put|strong="H3947"\w* \w ashes|strong="H665"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w her head|strong="H7218"\w* \w and tore|strong="H7167"\w* \w her|strong="H834"\w* \w robe|strong="H3801"\w*. \w And putting|strong="H7760"\w* \w her hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w her head|strong="H7218"\w*, \w she went away|strong="H1980"\w* \w crying aloud|strong="H2199"\w*.
