\p “\w My son|strong="H1121"\w*,” \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w replied|strong="H559"\w*, “\w why|strong="H4100"\w* \w do you|strong="H859"\w* \w want to run|strong="H7323"\w*, since you will \w not|strong="H369"\w* \w receive|strong="H4672"\w* \w a reward|strong="H1309"\w*?”
\p \v 23 “\w No matter what|strong="H4100"\w*, \w I want to run|strong="H7323"\w*!” \w he replied|strong="H1961"\w*.
