\c 19
\s1 Joab Reproves David
\p \v 1 \w Then it was reported|strong="H5046"\w* \w to Joab|strong="H3097"\w*, “\w The king|strong="H4428"\w* \w is weeping|strong="H1058"\w* \w and mourning|strong="H56"\w* \w over|strong="H5921"\w* \w Absalom|strong="H53"\w*.” \v 2 \w And that|strong="H1931"\w* \w day’s|strong="H3117"\w* \w victory|strong="H8668"\w* \w was turned|strong="H1961"\w* \w into mourning|strong="H60"\w* \w for all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the people|strong="H5971"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w on that|strong="H1931"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w* \w they|strong="H5971"\w* \w were told|strong="H8085"\w*, “\w The king|strong="H4428"\w* \w is grieving|strong="H6087"\w* \w over|strong="H5921"\w* \w his son|strong="H1121"\w*.”
\p \v 3 \w So they|strong="H5971"\w* \w returned|strong="H935"\w* \w to the city|strong="H5892"\w* \w quietly|strong="H1589"\w* \w that|strong="H1931"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*, \w as|strong="H834"\w* \w people|strong="H5971"\w* \w steal away|strong="H1589"\w* \w in humiliation|strong="H3637"\w* \w after fleeing|strong="H5127"\w* \w a battle|strong="H4421"\w*. \v 4 \w But the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w covered|strong="H3813"\w* \w his face|strong="H6440"\w* \w and cried out|strong="H2199"\w* \w at the top|strong="H1419"\w* \w of his voice|strong="H6963"\w*, “\w O my son|strong="H1121"\w* \w Absalom|strong="H53"\w*! \w O Absalom|strong="H53"\w*, \w my son|strong="H1121"\w*, \w my son|strong="H1121"\w*!”
\p \v 5 \w Then Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w went|strong="H935"\w* \w into|strong="H413"\w* \w the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w* \w to the king|strong="H4428"\w*, “\w Today|strong="H3117"\w* \w you have disgraced|strong="H954"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w your servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w who have saved|strong="H4422"\w* \w your life|strong="H5315"\w* \w and the lives|strong="H5315"\w* \w of your sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w and daughters|strong="H1323"\w*, \w of your wives|strong="H802"\w*, \w and of your concubines|strong="H6370"\w*. \v 6 \w You love|strong="H157"\w* \w those who hate you|strong="H8130"\w* \w and hate|strong="H8130"\w* \w those who love you|strong="H157"\w*! \w For you have made it clear|strong="H5046"\w* \w today|strong="H3117"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w the commanders|strong="H8269"\w* \w and soldiers|strong="H5650"\w* \w mean nothing|strong="H369"\w* to you. \w I know|strong="H3045"\w* \w today|strong="H3117"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w if|strong="H3808"\w* \w Absalom|strong="H53"\w* \w were alive|strong="H2416"\w* \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w of us were dead|strong="H4191"\w*, \w it would have pleased you|strong="H3477"\w*!
