\s1 Mephibosheth Excused
\p \v 24 \w Then Mephibosheth|strong="H4648"\w*, \w Saul’s|strong="H7586"\w* \w grandson|strong="H1121"\w*, \w went down|strong="H3381"\w* \w to meet|strong="H7122"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w*. \w He had not|strong="H3808"\w* \w cared|strong="H6213"\w* \w for his feet|strong="H7272"\w* \w or|strong="H3808"\w* \w trimmed|strong="H6213"\w* \w his mustache|strong="H8222"\w* \w or|strong="H853"\w* \w washed|strong="H3526"\w* \w his clothes|strong="H899"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the day|strong="H3117"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w had left|strong="H1980"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the day|strong="H3117"\w* \w he returned|strong="H935"\w* \w safely|strong="H7965"\w*. \v 25 \w And|strong="H1961"\w* \w he came|strong="H935"\w* \w from Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w to meet|strong="H7122"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w*, \w who|strong="H4428"\w* \w asked|strong="H559"\w* him, “\w Mephibosheth|strong="H4648"\w*, \w why|strong="H4100"\w* \w did you not|strong="H3808"\w* \w go|strong="H1980"\w* \w with me|strong="H5973"\w*?”
\p \v 26 “\w My lord|strong="H113"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w*,” \w he replied|strong="H559"\w*, “\w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w I|strong="H5650"\w* \w am lame|strong="H6455"\w*, \w I|strong="H5650"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w I will have my donkey|strong="H2543"\w* \w saddled|strong="H2280"\w*\f + \fr 19:26 \ft LXX, Syriac, and Vulgate \fqa Saddle a donkey for me\ft ; Hebrew \fqa I will saddle a donkey for myself\f* \w so that I may ride|strong="H7392"\w* \w on it|strong="H5921"\w* \w and go|strong="H1980"\w* \w with|strong="H854"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w*.’ \w But my servant Ziba|strong="H5650"\w* \w deceived me|strong="H7411"\w*, \v 27 \w and he has slandered|strong="H7270"\w* \w your servant|strong="H5650"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w my lord|strong="H113"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w*.
\p \w Yet my lord|strong="H113"\w* \w the king is|strong="H4428"\w* \w like the angel|strong="H4397"\w*\f + \fr 19:27 \ft Or \fqa Angel\f* \w of God|strong="H430"\w*, \w so do|strong="H6213"\w* \w what is good|strong="H2896"\w* \w in your eyes|strong="H5869"\w*. \v 28 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of my grandfather|strong="H1"\w* \w deserves death|strong="H4194"\w* \w from my lord|strong="H113"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w*, \w yet you have set|strong="H7896"\w* \w your servant|strong="H5650"\w* \w among those who eat|strong="H398"\w* \w at your table|strong="H7979"\w*. \w What|strong="H4100"\w* \w further|strong="H5750"\w* \w right, then|strong="H6666"\w*, \w do I have|strong="H3426"\w* \w to keep|strong="H5750"\w* \w appealing|strong="H2199"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w*?”
