\s1 Contention over the King
\p \v 41 \w Soon|strong="H2009"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the men|strong="H376"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w came|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w and asked|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Why|strong="H4069"\w* \w did our brothers|strong="H251"\w*, \w the men|strong="H376"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w*, \w take you away secretly|strong="H1589"\w* \w and bring the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w and his household|strong="H1004"\w* \w across|strong="H5674"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H3383"\w*, \w together with|strong="H5973"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w of David’s|strong="H1732"\w* \w men|strong="H376"\w*?”
