\p \v 5 \w So Amasa|strong="H6021"\w* \w went|strong="H1980"\w* \w to summon|strong="H2199"\w* \w Judah|strong="H3063"\w*, \w but he took longer|strong="H309"\w* \w than|strong="H4480"\w* \w the time|strong="H4150"\w* \w allotted him|strong="H3259"\w*.
\p \v 6 \w And David|strong="H1732"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Abishai|strong="H52"\w*, “\w Now|strong="H6258"\w* \w Sheba|strong="H7652"\w* \w the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Bichri|strong="H1075"\w* \w will do us more harm|strong="H3415"\w* \w than|strong="H4480"\w* \w Absalom|strong="H53"\w*. \w Take|strong="H3947"\w* \w your lord’s|strong="H113"\w* \w servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w and pursue him|strong="H7291"\w*, \w or|strong="H6435"\w* \w he will find|strong="H4672"\w* \w fortified|strong="H1219"\w* \w cities|strong="H5892"\w* \w and elude|strong="H5337"\w* \w us|strong="H5869"\w*.\f + \fr 20:6 \ft Or \fqa and snatch away our eyes \ft or \fqa and do us serious harm\f*”
\p \v 7 \w So Joab’s|strong="H3097"\w* \w men|strong="H582"\w*, \w along with the Cherethites|strong="H3774"\w*, \w the Pelethites|strong="H6432"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the mighty men|strong="H1368"\w*, \w marched out of|strong="H3318"\w* \w Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w in pursuit|strong="H7291"\w* \w of Sheba|strong="H7652"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Bichri|strong="H1075"\w*. \v 8 \w And while they|strong="H1992"\w* \w were at|strong="H5973"\w* \w the great|strong="H1419"\w* \w stone|strong="H68"\w* \w in Gibeon|strong="H1391"\w*, \w Amasa|strong="H6021"\w* \w joined|strong="H935"\w* \w them|strong="H6440"\w*.
\p \w Now Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w was dressed|strong="H2296"\w* \w in military attire|strong="H4055"\w*, \w with a dagger|strong="H2719"\w* \w strapped|strong="H6775"\w* \w to his belt|strong="H2290"\w*. \w And as he|strong="H1931"\w* \w stepped forward|strong="H3318"\w*, \w he slipped the dagger|strong="H5307"\w* \w from its sheath|strong="H8593"\w*.\f + \fr 20:8 \ft Literally \fqa Now Joab was dressed in military attire, and over it was a belt around his waist with a dagger in its sheath. And as he stepped forward, it fell out.\f* \v 9 “\w Are you|strong="H859"\w* \w well|strong="H7965"\w*, \w my brother|strong="H251"\w*?” \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w asked|strong="H559"\w* \w Amasa|strong="H6021"\w*. \w And with his right|strong="H3225"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w grabbed|strong="H270"\w* \w Amasa|strong="H6021"\w* \w by the beard|strong="H2206"\w* \w to kiss|strong="H5401"\w* him.
\p \v 10 \w Amasa|strong="H6021"\w* \w was not|strong="H3808"\w* \w on guard|strong="H8104"\w* \w against the dagger|strong="H2719"\w* \w in Joab’s|strong="H3097"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w*, \w and Joab stabbed|strong="H5221"\w* him \w in|strong="H413"\w* \w the stomach|strong="H2570"\w* \w and spilled out his intestines|strong="H4578"\w* \w on the ground|strong="H776"\w*. \w And Joab did not need|strong="H3808"\w* \w to strike him again|strong="H8138"\w*, \w for Amasa was dead|strong="H4191"\w*. \w Then Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w and his brother|strong="H251"\w* \w Abishai|strong="H52"\w* \w pursued|strong="H7291"\w* \w Sheba|strong="H7652"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Bichri|strong="H1075"\w*.
\p \v 11 \w One|strong="H376"\w* \w of Joab’s|strong="H3097"\w* \w young men|strong="H5288"\w* \w stood|strong="H5975"\w* \w near Amasa|strong="H5921"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Whoever|strong="H4310"\w* \w favors|strong="H2654"\w* \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w*, \w and whoever|strong="H4310"\w* \w is for David|strong="H1732"\w*, \w let him follow|strong="H310"\w* \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w*!” \v 12 \w But Amasa|strong="H6021"\w* \w wallowed|strong="H1556"\w* \w in his blood|strong="H1818"\w* \w in the middle|strong="H8432"\w* \w of the road|strong="H4546"\w*, \w and when the man|strong="H376"\w* \w saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the troops|strong="H5971"\w* \w were stopping there|strong="H5975"\w*, \w he dragged|strong="H5437"\w* \w the body|strong="H6021"\w* \w off|strong="H4480"\w* \w the road|strong="H4546"\w* \w into a field|strong="H7704"\w* \w and threw|strong="H7993"\w* \w a garment|strong="H899"\w* \w over it|strong="H5921"\w*. \v 13 \w As soon as|strong="H834"\w* \w Amasa’s body was removed|strong="H3014"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the road|strong="H4546"\w*, \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the men|strong="H376"\w* \w went on|strong="H5674"\w* \w with|strong="H310"\w* \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w to pursue|strong="H7291"\w* \w Sheba|strong="H7652"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Bichri|strong="H1075"\w*.
\p \v 14 \w Sheba passed|strong="H5674"\w* \w through all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the tribes|strong="H7626"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w to Abel-beth-maacah|strong="H59"\w*\f + \fr 20:14 \ft Hebrew \fqa to Abel and Beth-maacah\ft ; see verse 15.\f* \w and through the entire region of|strong="H3605"\w* \w the Berites|strong="H1276"\w*,\f + \fr 20:14 \ft Hebrew; LXX and Vulgate \fqa Bicrites\f* \w who gathered together|strong="H7034"\w* \w and followed|strong="H935"\w* \w him|strong="H310"\w*.
\p \v 15 \w And Joab’s troops came|strong="H935"\w* \w and besieged|strong="H6696"\w* \w Sheba|strong="H5921"\w* \w in Abel-beth-maacah|strong="H59"\w* \w and built|strong="H8210"\w* \w a siege ramp|strong="H5550"\w* \w against the outer rampart|strong="H2426"\w* \w of the city|strong="H5892"\w*.
\p \w As all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the troops|strong="H5971"\w* \w with|strong="H854"\w* \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w were battering|strong="H7843"\w* \w the wall|strong="H2346"\w* \w to topple it|strong="H5307"\w*, \v 16 \w a wise|strong="H2450"\w* \w woman|strong="H802"\w* \w called out|strong="H7121"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the city|strong="H5892"\w*, “\w Listen|strong="H8085"\w*! \w Listen|strong="H8085"\w*! \w Please|strong="H4994"\w* \w tell|strong="H559"\w* \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w* \w to come|strong="H7126"\w* \w here|strong="H2008"\w* \w so that I may speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w with him|strong="H413"\w*.”
\p \v 17 \w When he had come near|strong="H7126"\w* \w to her|strong="H413"\w*, \w the woman|strong="H802"\w* \w asked|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Are you|strong="H859"\w* \w Joab|strong="H3097"\w*?”
