\q1 “\w The oracle|strong="H5002"\w* \w of David|strong="H1732"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Jesse|strong="H3448"\w*,
\q2 \w the oracle|strong="H5002"\w* \w of the man|strong="H1397"\w* \w raised|strong="H6965"\w* \w on high|strong="H5920"\w*,
