\q2 \w and the sweet|strong="H5273"\w* \w psalmist|strong="H2158"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*:\f + \fr 23:1 \ft Or \fqa the hero of the songs of Israel \ft or \fqa the favorite of the Strong One of Israel\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 2 \w The Spirit|strong="H7307"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w spoke through|strong="H1696"\w* me;
\q2 \w His word|strong="H4405"\w* \w was on|strong="H5921"\w* \w my tongue|strong="H3956"\w*.
